---
---

<section class="founder section">
  <div class="shell founder-grid">
    <div class="founder-copy reveal">
      <p class="kicker">Meet the founder</p>
      <h2>Ellie, the heart<br />behind <span>Higa Power.</span></h2>
      <p class="lead">
        “I started Higa Power to help women overcome the financial and personal barriers that stand between them and a transformative Camino.”
      </p>
      <p>
        I believe in the power of community, resilience and the magic of the Camino. Let’s make dreams come true together.
      </p>
      <div class="signature">
        Ellie <span>Founder, Higa Power</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="founder-image reveal">
      <img
        src="/assets/images/founder-ellie.jpg"
        alt="Ellie, founder of Higa Power"
        width="1036"
        height="1036"
        loading="lazy"
      />
      <div class="founder-mark">
        <img src="/assets/images/higa-power-logo.jpg" alt="" width="180" height="180" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .founder-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 0.86fr;
    gap: clamp(50px, 9vw, 130px);
    align-items: center;
  }

  .founder-copy .lead {
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }

  .founder-copy > p:not(.lead) {
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .signature {
    margin-top: 36px;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    color: var(--color-purple);
    font-size: 31px;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .signature span {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 5px;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-style: normal;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  }

  .founder-image {
    position: relative;
  }

  .founder-image > img {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 0.9;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: 4px 4px 120px 4px;
  }

  .founder-mark {
    position: absolute;
    left: -38px;
    bottom: -38px;
    padding: 14px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--color-cream);
  }

  .founder-mark img {
    width: 100px;
    height: 100px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  @media (max-width: 960px) {
    .founder-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .founder-image {
      max-width: 660px;
      margin-left: auto;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .founder-mark {
      left: -10px;
      bottom: -28px;
    }

    .founder-mark img {
      width: 76px;
      height: 76px;
    }
  }
</style>
